:"0x0D9BBFD387C3FCB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123653003:1":{"text":"...잠깐, <style=\"highlight\">호루라기</style> 어디 갔지? 방금 전까지 가방에 있었는데?!","source_cn":"……等等，我的<style=highlight>哨子<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C6903EC33B76CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123653004:1":{"text":"블랙하울이 곧 도착한다고요! 멍하지 구경만 하고 있지 말고 같이 좀 찾아줘요!","source_cn":"黑嚎的人马上就到了！你也别愣着，赶紧帮我一起找吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x29AF2A7E361526F6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"블랙하울이 곧 도착한다고요! 멍하지 구경만 하고 있지 말고 같이 좀 찾아줘요!","female":"블랙하울이 곧 도착한다고요! 멍하지 구경만 하고 있지 말고 같이 좀 찾아줘요!","variant_male_record_index":"128010","variant_female_record_index":"128011","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人苏琳":{"text":"상인 수린","source":"商人苏琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11236540.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236540","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11236540","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123654001:1":{"text":"휴! 다행이다! 호루라기를 찾다니!\n정말 고맙습니다.","source_cn":"谢天谢地，还好没把哨子弄丢。\\n也多谢你了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8FECDD238CA946","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"휴! 다행이다! 호루라기를 찾다니!\n정말 고맙습니다.","female":"휴! 다행이다! 호루라기를 찾다니!\n정말 고맙습니다.","variant_male_record_index":"128012","variant_female_record_index":"128013","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123654002:1":{"text":"...늦어서 죄송해요! 오는 길에 새끼 초코보가 말썽을 피워서요.","source_cn":"——我来晚了！真是不好意思，都怪这群小陆行鸟太闹腾了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA60085FD0161B08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123654003:1":{"text":"하지만 걱정 마세요. 이 새끼 초코보들은 블랙하울 부족에서 정성껏 키워서 다들 건강해요!","source_cn":"不过你也放心，这些鸟崽子都是我们黑嚎氏族精心饲养的，保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FD0CE95D4420DDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1123654004:1":{"text":"하지만 시간이 너무 많이 지체됐다고요! 그러니까... 가격 얘기를 좀 해볼까요?","source_cn":"但你耽误了我这么久的时间——价格总还有得商量吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD67E5D865679620D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123654005:1":{"text":"뭐, 뭐라고요?! 가격은 이미 다 협의된 거잖아요!","source_cn":"什、什么？！价格不是早就谈好了吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x909A73C9A338FEE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人苏琳":{"text":"상인 수린","source":"商人苏琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:送货员瓦勒":{"text":"배송원 베일","source":"送货员瓦勒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}}}